  "worked_solution": "The recursive formula for a geometric sequence with common ratio $r$ takes the form\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=r\\cdot {a}_{n}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the first term is ${a}_{1}=24,$ and we can calculate the common ratio $r$ as\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{-12}{24}=-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the recursive formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=-\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{n},\\,{a}_{1}=24,\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$",
